note contract 5 abstract lines 145-150 and 1 lines 36-38: with om2 diag the exact constructor
note body reports `omc-check 1 erased line=N rule=dup32`, N = the line of `ret seal` (confirmed by erratum E8).
note Function mode (no fn main), entry `entry` returns ulong, so no abstract type crosses the entry.
om2 diag
abstract dup32 ulong ops rotr xor
holds dup32 dup32
fn dup32mk x uint to dup32
ret seal dup32 or shl ulong x 32 ulong x
end
fn entry x uint to ulong
ret open dup32mk x
end
